# Skill shot pinned to outcome 1 (coins): the wheel's random outcome 0 (mystery) can award an extra ball, which would
# make drain 3 not the last ball, and outcomes 3..7 start modes.
# Three balls, each drained by a ball placed in the drain wall once the ball save has run out (one-way
# event + 1510 frames). Drain 1 (modes_played 0, targets 0: nothing to count) and 2 go to the next ball; drain 3
# (BallCount == 1, last player) sets last_ball and tilt_lock and runs mode 17 then mode 16 in the same frame; after the
# count mode 1 (game over), ball_count 0, the last-ball flag cleared by the final step.
init window 960 666
init fixed_dt 10
init seed 1
init dump_period 10
init watch s_bwal610.active
10 key down new_game
11 key up new_game
206 poke s_launcher1 message_field 1
207 event s_oneway3 ControlCollision
1730 place 0 0 15.6 0.37 0 1 5 0x1
1800 expect ball_count == 2
1800 expect mode == 3
1800 expect last_ball == 0
2599 poke s_launcher1 message_field 1
2600 event s_oneway3 ControlCollision
4100 poke s_bwal610 active 1
4130 place 0 0 15.6 0.37 0 1 5 0x1
4250 expect ball_count == 1
4250 expect mode == 3
4260 expect last_ball == 0
4261 expect s_bwal610.active == 1
4299 poke s_launcher1 message_field 1
4300 event s_oneway3 ControlCollision
5800 event a_drop5 ControlCollision
5801 event a_drop6 ControlCollision
5802 event a_drop7 ControlCollision
# Mode17's MissionComplete runs in the same frame as the tilt-lock entry (mode 17 then 16) and clears s_bwal610's active flag
# (the mode 17 transient has no timeline row of its own): poked on before drain 3, off after; the same poke before drain 2 (not the last ball) stays on.
5810 poke s_bwal610 active 1
5820 expect s_bwal610.active == 1
5830 place 0 0 15.6 0.37 0 1 5 0x1
5840 expect last_ball == 1
5840 expect tilt_lock == 1
5840 expect mode == 16
5840 expect s_bwal610.active == 0
5836-5840 expect text info_text_box display id 3028
6330-6340 expect text info_text_box display id 3027
6500 expect mode == 1
6500 expect ball_count == 0
6500 expect last_ball == 0
6600 quit
